<title>INDIA: India's advance estimates of 96/97 national income.</title>
<headline>India's advance estimates of 96/97 national income.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are advance estimates</p>
<p>of India's national income for 1996/97 (April-March) at</p>
<p>constant 1980/81 prices.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  1) NATIONAL PRODUCT (billion rupees)   1995/96    1996/97</p>
<p>- Gross national product at</p>
<p>	  factor cost			   2,673.30   2,852.91</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			7.0	  6.7</p>
<p>- Net national product at</p>
<p>	  factor cost			   2,367.38   2,525.57</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			6.9	  6.7</p>
<p>2) DOMESTIC PRODUCT (billion rupees)</p>
<p>- Gross domestic product at</p>
<p>	  factor cost			   2,742.09   2,929.33</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			7.1	  6.8</p>
<p>- Net domestic product at</p>
<p>	  factor cost			   2,436.17   2,602.00</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			7.0	  6.8</p>
<p>3) ESTIMATES AT PER CAPITA LEVEL</p>
<p>     - Population (millions)		    920	  936</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			1.8	  1.7</p>
<p>- Per capita Net national product</p>
<p>	  at factor cost (rupees)	     2,573	2,698</p>
<p>	 Percentage increase			5.1	  4.9</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024  </p>
<p>    at factor cost (rupees)	     2,573	2,698</p>
<p>    Percentage increase			5.1	  4.9</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
